  "title": "Uncle Terry Meat",
  "description": "A wonderful marinated chuck roast that &#39;s finished on the grill. Vegetable oil, ketchup and red wine are combined with mustard, chili powder, vinegar, garlic, and celery salt for the marinade. The roast is pierced all over with a fork and marinated.",
  "authors": [
    "Phyllis Kalajian"
  ],
